# Host redirects cannot be expressed here. www.world-news.xyz and *.pages.dev ->
# https://world-news.xyz live in functions/_middleware.ts. The www redirect is always on. The pages.dev
# redirect stays off until REDIRECT_PAGES_DEV=true, so preview URLs and
# `wrangler pages dev` keep working before the DNS switch.
# Pages does not apply this file to responses served by Functions, so the bare
# hubs below are also redirected in the middleware (one hop with the www rule).
# Do not add a catch-all rewrite. /ads.txt, /sitemap.xml, /robots.txt, /api/*
# and unknown paths must not become the app shell. Unknown paths use public/404.html.
# Destination is / (which serves index.html) rather than /index.html: Pages
# canonicalizes a rewritten /index.html into a 308 back to /.
# /story/:id is not listed: delisted headlines keep their noindex 已下架 page.

/focus https://world-news.xyz/ 301
/focus/ https://world-news.xyz/ 301
/board https://world-news.xyz/ 301
/board/ https://world-news.xyz/ 301
/story https://world-news.xyz/ 301
/story/ https://world-news.xyz/ 301
/region/:code / 200
/category/:slug / 200
